      "summary": "The bill amends the Elementary and Secondary Education Act to have the Secretary of Education produce best practices on secure firearm storage and suicide prevention and to require certain local educational agencies to create and distribute firearm-safety guidance. Guidance must be distributed to students, parents, and other community members.",
