    "impact": {
      "summary": "The bill would require the Education Secretary to publish firearm secure\u2011storage and suicide\u2011prevention best practices and have covered school districts distribute guidance to students, parents, and communities. It requires consultation with ATF, HHS (CDC, NIH, SAMHSA), FBI, law enforcement, non\u2011industry nonprofits, educators, and mental\u2011health professionals.",
